# Awakening (Zilart 17), current; the status a bit field. The zone-in to Norg plays 176 while bit 0 is clear (its finish
# adds 1), then nothing; Gilgamesh plays 177; Lower Jeuno's _6tc plays 20 while bit 1 is clear (its finish adds 2), then
# the handler returns nil and _6tc is the NPC's own ITS_LOCKED.
lists Norg/onZoneIn/1 Norg/onEventFinish/176 Norg/Gilgamesh/onTrigger Norg/onEventFinish/232 Norg/onEventFinish/234 LowerJeuno/_6tc/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/20
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=36,0,-15 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart Awakening current
login
warp 98,-7,-12 Norg open                    # bit 0 clear: 176
finish                                  # status 1
trigger Gilgamesh                       # 177
finish
warp 98,-7,-12 Norg open                    # bit 0 set: nothing
warp 36,0,-15 LowerJeuno
trigger _6tc                            # bit 1 clear: 20
finish                                  # status 3
trigger _6tc                            # bit 1 set: the NPC's own ITS_LOCKED
finish-if-event
